# Copy this file to .env and fill in a real value. `.env` itself is
# git-ignored and must never be committed.
#
#   cp .env.example .env      # then edit .env
#
# GEMINI_API_KEY is the ONLY secret anything in this repo needs. Nothing else
# -- building/running the challenges, the reference solutions, the rubric,
# calibration, or the acceptance gate -- requires an API key at all. This key
# is used for exactly one optional thing: tasks/edge-pivot/llm_agent.py, which
# drives a real Gemini model against the live service to measure how a real
# agent performs (see docs/calibration.md).
#
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey -- it looks like
# AIzaSy... (roughly 39 characters). Do NOT paste a placeholder like
# "your_key" here; llm_agent.py checks for that and will refuse to run rather
# than silently burning your turn budget on failed API calls.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
